# Thermaltake TH420V2 Ultra LCD (VID 0x264a, PID 0x233c)
# Grant access to the user logged in at the local seat (systemd-logind "uaccess").
# Must sort before 73-seat-late.rules, which applies the uaccess ACL — hence "70-".
SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ENV{DEVTYPE}=="usb_device", ATTR{idVendor}=="264a", ATTR{idProduct}=="233c", MODE="0660", TAG+="uaccess"
